    "status": "draft",
    "summary": "Renames the three packages so nothing resolves under an upstream name, versions them at 0.15.0-patched.1 because the public API changed, keeps the library names and the internal dependency keys so consumers and the feature table need no rewriting, and adds a publication workflow and an independent review workflow with separate triggers and separate credentials. Records the release work ledger, and the acceptance corrections the rename forced.\n",
